<!-- The Dumbify monogram: a capital D from Barlow Bold, the app's own typeface,
     in ReverseFg paper on the Accent900 ground.

     The outline is the real glyph, lifted from res/font/barlow_bold.ttf rather
     than redrawn - no hand-built letterform would match the UI's type. It is
     scaled to a 46dp cap height and centred on the 108dp canvas, which puts the
     bounds at 33.65x46dp and its corners 28.5dp from centre, inside the 66dp
     safe circle every launcher mask keeps.

     The bowl is a hole via non-zero winding (the font's contours run in opposite
     directions), so do not set android:fillType here. Regenerate with the
     glyph-extraction step documented in art/dumbify-icon-master.svg if the cap
     height or typeface ever changes. -->
